<p class="govuk-body">
  You are involved in a contested financial remedy case. You may need to prepare some documents and upload them for the court before your next hearing. All documents you upload for the court must be emailed to other parties in the case.
</p>

<p class="govuk-body">
  You will find instructions about which documents to prepare on the order you received from the court.
</p>

<div class="govuk-warning-text">
  <span class="govuk-warning-text__icon" aria-hidden="true">!</span>
  <strong class="govuk-warning-text__text">
    <span class="govuk-visually-hidden">Warning</span>
    You cannot use this service to submit applications such as the D11, or anything else that needs a court response, such as asking for an update from the court. You should email these to the court.
  </strong>
</div>

<a href="/upload/before-you-start" role="button" draggable="false" class="govuk-button" data-module="govuk-button">
  Go to document upload
</a>
